  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: e9a1f2822809deb49a0ce098da0fddca, type: 3}
  dialogueText: "Ti \u2018pakawanen nak man\u2019 ket usaren iti nadumaduma a kasasaad,
    kas iti panangdawat iti permiso, panangawag iti atensyon ti sabali a tao, wenno
    panaglabas iti nadagsen a lugar."
  translatedText: "Pakawanen nak man is what you say in various situations, such
    as asking permission, getting someone\u2019s attention, or passing through a
    crowded place."
